Actually, could the girl in my dream be you,

133
00:05:06,780 --> 00:05:07,160
Haruka?

134
00:05:09,220 --> 00:05:11,160
Th-That can't be!

135
00:05:11,160 --> 00:05:15,670
I haven't confessed to you or anything yet.

136
00:05:15,920 --> 00:05:19,250
You're right! She was like, so cute!

137
00:05:19,250 --> 00:05:22,260
Wha- That's so mean!

138
00:05:24,420 --> 00:05:25,460
Sorry 'bout that.

139
00:05:27,840 --> 00:05:29,100
It's Gekkou-sama!

140
00:05:29,100 --> 00:05:31,510
Gekkou-sama, Gekkou-sama! Look at me!

141
00:05:31,510 --> 00:05:34,970
