152
00:06:08,400 --> 00:06:12,580
The superstar who joined the student council right after he entered high school.

153
00:06:12,580 --> 00:06:15,060
The graceful passing of Kurenai Gekkou-sama, huh?

154
00:06:15,060 --> 00:06:19,840
