325
00:15:17,810 --> 00:15:21,250
Wow, awesome! How come you're still alive?

326
00:15:21,250 --> 00:15:22,520
You some headless human?

327
00:15:22,520 --> 00:15:26,320
No, more importantly, isn't that body over there me?

328
00:15:26,320 --> 00:15:26,940
